This implementation had been derived by Gunnar Ritter from ex/vi 3.7 of
6/7/85 and the BSD termcap library, originally from the 2.11BSD
distribution. He had added some useful enhancements, most notably UTF-8
support.

The last release of heirloom-ex-vi had been version 050325 (4.0). Until
2007 he added new features, e.g. dynamically allocated screen buffers
for resizing the terminal and support for files with arbitrary line
length.
